Start Platinum! The world!

255
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:50,941
If I were a baton man, I'd say you're gonna
use your stand to deflect those bullets.

256
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:54,216
But time has been stopped
for a total of five seconds.

257
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:58,915
You won't even be able to
see this spear coming at you.

258
00:20:04,120 --> 00:20:08,380
When time goes back to normal, that
spear will fly straight through you.

259
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:14,280
Three more seconds, two
seconds, one second.

260
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:18,320
Now time will resume.

261
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:24,510
Ah!

262
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,327
What the hell just happened?

263
00:20:30,540 --> 00:20:32,069
The spear missed its mark.

264
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:34,574
It moved slightly during the time stop.

265
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,550
It...

266
00:20:36,633 --> 00:20:37,463
it failed.

267
00:20:37,740 --> 00:20:38,880
He's still alive.

268
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:41,440
He's opening the door.

269
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:45,077
It looks like he's trying to
get inside the space shuttle.

270
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:48,748
Yeah, and now this thing is
starting to float in the air too.

271
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:54,080
The priest is taking shelter in the
goddamn displaced space shuttle!

272
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:57,460
He managed to avoid the spear.

273
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:58,840
But how?

274
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:00,360
It makes no sense.

275
00:21:01,220 --> 00:21:02,050
Hey, you guys.

276
00:21:02,340 --> 00:21:04,869
I don't think he's just
trying to get away.

277
00:21:05,060 --> 00:21:06,400
It can't be.

278
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:08,237
Did he...

279
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:11,997
Could he have discovered something
that's giving him the advantage?

280
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:15,904
Did he actually find the missing
element to complete his ability?

281
00:21:34,860 --> 00:21:38,625
You are the ones who have been
helping to raise me up all along!

282
00:21:38,900 --> 00:21:42,841
Ever since you were in prison, you
have been there, lending me aid!

283
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:49,800
Our Father who art in heaven, I
beseech you to lead and guide me!

284
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:55,540
I ask you to please watch over me, so
I may not walk down the wrong path!

285
00:21:56,220 --> 00:21:59,840
It is to your very will that
I shall dedicate myself!

286
00:22:01,420 --> 00:22:02,820
I can feel it!

287
00:22:12,660 --> 00:22:13,657
The coordinates!

288
00:22:13,740 --> 00:22:14,640
I'm here!

289
00:22:25,980 --> 00:22:29,737
Although you think I cope,

290
00:22:29,820 --> 00:22:35,180
my head is filled with hope.

291
00:22:36,460 --> 00:22:43,440
Of some place other than here!

292
00:22:46,180 --> 00:22:49,897
Although you think I smile,

293
00:22:49,980 --> 00:22:55,040
Inside and all the while,

294
00:22:56,720 --> 00:23:03,080
I'm wondering about my destiny?

295
00:23:05,660 --> 00:23:07,577
I'm thinking

296
00:23:07,660 --> 00:23:13,257
about all the

297
00:23:13,340 --> 00:23:18,117
things I'd like

298
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:24,160
to do in my life.

299
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:28,937
I'm a dreamer.

300
00:23:29,020 --> 00:23:34,100
A distant dreamer.

301
00:23:36,020 --> 00:23:39,100
Dreaming far away.

302
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:44,240
From today!

303
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:54,990
Thank you.

304
00:24:28,320 --> 00:24:29,760
Thank you.
